 has been observed that the primary relief claimed in the complaint is for possession of the property and not withdrawal from the project and rest of the relief regarding compensation is now sought to be withdrawn and only relief relating to possession and interest for delayed possession is to be claimed, accordingly, proposed amendment was allowed. Accordingly, complaint has been transferred to Authority and both the parties have been directed to appear before the Authority on 14.07.2021.','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,0,1,1,'legaladvrera','2021-07-12 12:27:05.000','legaladvrera','2021-07-12 12:27:05.000'),(128,42,'TR-AUTH00422021',2021,'AdCNo18092020TR-AUTH00422021',2123,'AdCNo18092020','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2021-08-05 00:00:00.000','2206','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','2205','Authority, RERA Punjab','','During the course of hearing held on 05.08.2021, it was stated by the complainant that he wants to claim the relief of possession and does not want to withdraw from the project.  Accordingly, the Ld. Adjudicating Officer has transferred the complaint to the Authority with a direction to the complainant to appear before the Authority on 18.08.2021 for further proceedings. ','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,0,1,1,'legaladvrera','2021-08-10 18:15:28.000','legaladvrera','2021-08-10 18:15:28.000'),(129,43,'TR-AUTH00432021',2021,'AdCNo01422021TR-AUTH00432021',2327,'AdCNo01422021','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2021-08-25 00:00:00.000','2206','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','2205','Authority, RERA Punjab','','During the course of the hearing held on 25.08.2021, it has been stated by the Complainant that he does not  press the relief of compensation. The Authority has the jurisdiction qua the other reliefs i.e. completion of amenities as promised by the respondent, assured return amount with interest and production of site plans etc. Accordingly, the present complaint has been transferred to Authority for 08.09.2021. The Complaint was directed to appear before the Authority on the said date for further proceedings.  ','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,0,1,1,'legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-01 01:53:05.000'),(130,44,'TR-AUTH00442021',2021,'AdCNo00352021TR-AUTH00442021',2177,'AdCNo00352021','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2021-08-24 00:00:00.000','2206','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','2205','Authority, RERA Punjab','','During the course of the hearing held on 24.08.2021, it has been observed that the complainant himself has withdrawn the relief of compensation in the rectified complaint, submitted online and the complainant has sought interest for every month of delay. Accordingly, it was directed to transfer the complaint to Authority and the complainant was directed to appear before the Authority on 08.09.2021 for further proceedings. ','','','0','','',1,1,'',1,0,0,0,1,1,'legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-02 09:29:20.000'),(131,45,'TR-AUTH00452021',2021,'AdCNo01882021TR-AUTH00452021',2394,'AdCNo01882021','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2021-09-21 00:00:00.000','2206','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','2205','Authority, RERA Punjab','','The Complainant vide email dated 17.09.2021 has requested to convert the complaint into form M. Moreover, in terms of Circular dated 05.03.2021 passed by the Authority, the relief sought by the Complainant falls with the Authority. Accordingly, the present complaint is transferred to Authority for further proceedings/directions please.','','','0','','',1,0,'',1,0,0,0,1,1,'legaladvrera','2021-09-21 07:47:25.000','legaladvrera','2021-09-21 07:47:25.000'),(132,46,'TR-AUTH00462021',2021,'AdCNo01762021TR-AUTH00462021',2379,'AdCNo01762021','FormTypeM','TransferToAUTH','2021-09-27 00:00:00.000','2206','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','2205','Authority, RERA Punjab','','The Complainant sought directions to  refund of amount of maintenance charges received from the complainant and restrain from charging the main